;; actor-profile-seed.kotoba.edn
;;
;; Seed Datoms for the `actors-v1` kotoba graph (schema: actor-profile.kotoba.edn).
;; Canonical declaration of every registered actor's identity + profile, from
;; which the publisher (50-infra/etzhayyim-did-web/scripts/publish-actor-records.mjs)
;; materializes (a) the per-actor did:web DID Document and (b) the
;; app.bsky.actor.getProfile view, then writes them to CF KV + (operator-gated)
;; ingests Datoms into kotoba. Per ADR-2606013800.
;;
;; Authoring note: `:actor/service` and `:actor/vm` are expressed here as native
;; EDN (vectors of string-keyed maps) for readability. The publisher serializes
;; them to the stored Datom attributes `:actor/service-json` / `:actor/vm-json`
;; (JSON strings) AND into the DID-doc `service[]` / `verificationMethod[]`.
;;
;; `:actor/vm` is "[]" for every actor at R0 — verificationMethod is a MIRROR of
;; the on-chain ERC725 Root.activeKey, never minted server-side (ADR-2605231525);
;; did:web trust root is TLS. It populates only when chain wiring lands.

{:graph {:name "actors-v1" :visibility :public}

